  "status": "Refused",
  "description": "Erection of additional storey to the footprint of the original dwellinghouse to following approved Class AA permitted development application (2024/1308) and following granted Lawful Development application (2024/1908)",
  "decision_conditions": [
    "&lt;p&gt;The proposed additional storey, by reason of its inappropriate detailed design, materiality and form, would result in a visually incongruous, discordant and overly dominant addition that fails to relate positively to the architectural character and proportions of the host dwelling or the surrounding streetscape. The contemporary articulation of the upper storey, combined with the gable roof above, would exacerbate the perceived bulk and scale of the development and appear at odds with the established form of development in the area. The development is therefore contrary to Policy LP1 of the Hackney Local Plan (LP33), Policies D3 and D4 of the London Plan (2021),&amp;nbsp; the Residential Extensions and Alterations SPD and the design objectives of the National Planning Policy Framework.&lt;/p&gt;"
  ],
